4. Keeping votre corps straight, reverse the motion, going hand over hand back to the position de départ.', 'Muscles secondaires : Biceps, Avant-bras, Milieu du dos. Niveau : Intermédiaire.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/London_Bridges/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Looking At Ceiling', 'Quadriceps', 'Autre', '1. Mettez-vous à genoux, holding your heels with both hands.
2. Lift your buttocks up and forward while bringing votre tête back to look up at the ceiling, to give an arch in votre dos.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Looking_At_Ceiling/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Low Cable Crossover', 'Pectoraux', 'Poulie', '1. To move into the position de départ, place the pulleys at the low position, select the resistance to be used and grasp a handle in each hand.
2. Step forward, gaining tension in the pulleys. Your palms should be facing forward, hands below the waist, and vos bras straight. C''est votre position de départ.
3. With a slight bend in vos bras, draw vos mains upward and toward the midline of votre corps. vos mains should come together in front of your poitrine, paumes vers up.
4. Return vos bras back to the position de départ Après une pause, .', 'Muscles secondaires : Épaules. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Low_Cable_Crossover/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Low Cable Triceps Extension', 'Triceps', 'Poulie', '1. Select the desired poids and lay down face up on the banc of a seated row machine that has a rope attached to it. votre tête should be pointing towards the attachment.
2. Grab the outside of the rope ends with your paumes vers each other (neutral grip).
3. Position your coudes so that they are bent at a angle de 90 degrés and your upper arms are perpendicular (angle de 90 degrés) to your torse. Conseil : Keep the coudes in and make sure that the upper arms point to the ceiling while your forearms point towards the pulley above votre tête. C''est votre position de départ.
4. As you Expirez, extend your lower arms until they are straight and vertical. The upper arms and coudes remain stationary throughout le mouvement. Only the forearms should move. Contract the triceps hard for a second.
5. As you Inspirez Lentement, Revenez en position de départ.
6. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Low_Cable_Triceps_Extension/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Low Pulley Row To Neck', 'Épaules', 'Poulie', '1. Sit on a low pulley row machine with a rope attachment.
2. Grab the ends of the rope using a palms-down grip and sit with votre dos straight and your genous slightly bent. Conseil : Keep votre dos almost completely vertical and vos bras fully extended in front of you. C''est votre position de départ.
3. While keeping your torse stationary, lift your coudes and start bending them as you pull the rope towards your neck while exhaling. Throughout le mouvement your upper arms should remain parallèle au sol. Conseil : Continue this motion until vos mains are almost next to your ears (the forearms will not be parallèle au sol at the end of le mouvement as they will be angled a bit upwards) and your coudes are out away from your sides.
4. After holding for a second or so at the contracted position, come back Lentement, to the position de départ as you inspirez. Conseil : Again, during no part of le mouvement should the torse move.
5. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Muscles secondaires : Biceps, Milieu du dos, Trapèzes. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Low_Pulley_Row_To_Neck/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Lower Back-SMR', 'Bas du dos', 'Foam roller', '1. In a seated position, place a foam roll under your lower back. Cross vos bras in front of you and protract your épaules. C''est votre position de départ.
2. Raise your hanches off of le sol and lean back, keeping your poids on your lower back. Now shift your poids slightly to one side, keeping your poids off of the spine and on the muscles to the side of it. Roll over your lower back, holding points of tension for 10-30 seconds. Répétez de l''autre côté.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Lower_Back-SMR/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Lower Back Curl', 'Abdominaux', 'Poids de corps', '1. Lie on your stomach with vos bras out to your sides. C''est votre position de départ.
2. Using your lower back muscles, extend your spine lifting your poitrine off of the ground. Do not use vos bras to push yourself up. Keep votre tête up during le mouvement. Répétez for 10-20 repetitions.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Lower_Back_Curl/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Lunge Pass Through', 'Ischio-jambiers', 'Kettlebell', '1. Tenez-vous debout avec your torse upright holding a kettlebell in your right hand. C''est votre position de départ.
2. Step forward with your left foot and lower your upper body down by flexing the hanche and the genou, keeping the torse upright. Lower votre dos genou until it nearly touches the ground.
3. As you lunge, pass the kettlebell under your front leg to your opposite hand.
4. Pressing through the heel of your foot, Revenez en position de départ.
5. Répétez le mouvement for the recommended amount of repetitions, alternating legs.', 'Muscles secondaires : Mollets, Fessiers, Quadriceps. Niveau : Intermédiaire.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Lunge_Pass_Through/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Lunge Sprint', 'Quadriceps', 'Machine', '1. Adjust a bar in a Smith machine to an appropriate height. Position yourself under the bar, racking it across the back of your épaules. Unrack the bar, and then split vos pieds, moving one foot forward and one foot back. C''est votre position de départ.
2. Lower votre dos genou nearly to the ground, flexing the genous and lowering your hanches as you do so.
3. At the bottom of the descent, immediately reverse direction. Explosively drive through the heel of your front foot with light pressure from votre dos foot. Jump up and reverse the position of vos jambes.
4. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Muscles secondaires : Mollets, Fessiers, Ischio-jambiers. Niveau : Intermédiaire.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Lunge_Sprint/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Lying Bent Leg Groin', 'Adducteurs', 'Autre', '1. Allongez-vous au sol with your genous bent and the soles of the feet pressed together. Have your partner hold your genous. C''est votre position de départ.
2. Attempt to squeeze your genous together, while your partner prevents any movement from occurring.
3. After 10-20 seconds, relax your muscles as your partner gently pushes your genous towards le sol. Be sure to inform your helper when the stretch is adequate to prevent injury or overstretching.', 'Niveau : Avancé.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Lying_Bent_Leg_Groin/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Lying Cable Curl', 'Biceps', 'Poulie', '1. Grab a straight bar or E-Z bar attachment that is attached to the low pulley with both hands, using an underhand (paumes vers up) épaule-width grip.
2. Allongez-vous au sol on top of an exercise mat in front of the poids stack with vos pieds flat against the frame of the pulley machine and vos jambes straight.
3. With vos bras extended and your coudes close to votre corps slightly bend vos bras. C''est votre position de départ.
4. While keeping your upper arms stationary and the coudes close to votre corps, curl the bar up Lentement, toward your poitrine as you Expirez and you squeeze the biceps.
5. After a second squeeze at the top of le mouvement, Lentement, Revenez en position de départ.
6. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Niveau : Intermédiaire.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Lying_Cable_Curl/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Lying Cambered Barbell Row', 'Milieu du dos', 'Barre', '1. Place a cambered bar underneath an exercise banc.
2. Lie face down on the exercise banc and grab the bar using a palms down (pronated grip) that is wider than épaule width. C''est votre position de départ.
3. As you expirez row the bar up as you keep the coudes close to votre corps to either your poitrine, in order to target the upper mid back, or to your stomach if targeting the lats is your goal.
4. After a second hold at the top, lower back down to the position de départ Lentement, as you inspirez.', 'Muscles secondaires : Biceps, Dos, Trapèzes. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Lying_Cambered_Barbell_Row/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Lying Close-Grip Bar Curl On High Pulley', 'Biceps', 'Poulie', '1. Place a flat banc in front of a high pulley or lat pulldown machine.
2. Hold the straight bar attachment using an prise en supination (palms up) that is about épaule width.
3. Allongez-vous au sol with votre tête over the end of the banc.
4. Now extend vos bras straight above your épaules. Your torse and vos bras should make a angle de 90 degrés and the coudes should be in. C''est votre position de départ.
5. As you Expirez, curl the bar down in a semicircular motion until it touches your chin. Squeeze the biceps for a second at the top contracted position. Conseil : As you execute this motion only the forearms should move. At no time should the upper arms be moving at all. They are to remain perpendicular throughout le mouvement.
6. Revenez en position de départ slowly.
7. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Lying_Close-Grip_Bar_Curl_On_High_Pulley/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Lying Close-Grip Barbell Triceps Extension Behind The Head', 'Triceps', 'Barre', '1. While holding a barre or EZ Curl bar with a pronated grip (paumes vers l''avant), Allongez-vous au sol on a flat banc with votre tête close to the end of the banc. Conseil : If you are holding a barre grab it using a épaule-width grip and if you are using an E-Z Bar grab it on the inner handles.
2. Extend vos bras in front of you and Lentement, bring the bar back in a semi circular motion (while keeping the arms extended) to a position over votre tête. At the end of this step vos bras should be overhead and parallèle au sol. C''est votre position de départ. Conseil : Keep your coudes in en permanence.
3. As you inspirez, lower the bar by bending at the coudes and while keeping the upper arm stationary. Keep lowering the bar until your forearms are perpendiculaire à le sol.
4. As you expirez bring the bar back up to the position de départ by pushing the bar up in a semi-circular motion until the lower arms are also parallèle au sol. Contract the triceps hard at the top of le mouvement for a second. Conseil : Again, only the forearms should move. The upper arms should remain stationary en permanence.
5. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Niveau : Intermédiaire.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Lying_Close-Grip_Barbell_Triceps_Extension_Behind_The_Head/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Lying Close-Grip Barbell Triceps Press To Chin', 'Triceps', 'Barre EZ', '1. While holding a barre or EZ Curl bar with a pronated grip (paumes vers l''avant), Allongez-vous au sol on a flat banc with votre tête off the end of the banc. Conseil : If you are holding a barre grab it using a épaule-width grip and if you are using an E-Z Bar grab it on the inner handles.
2. Extend vos bras in front of you as you hold the barre over your poitrine. The arms should be perpendiculaire à your torse (angle de 90 degrés). C''est votre position de départ.
3. As you inspirez, lower the bar in a semi-circular motion by bending at the coudes and while keeping the upper arm stationary and coudes in. Keep lowering the bar until it lightly touches your chin.
4. As you expirez bring the bar back up to the position de départ by pushing the bar up in a semi-circular motion. Contract the triceps hard at the top of le mouvement for a second. Conseil : Again, only the forearms should move. The upper arms should remain stationary en permanence.
5. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Niveau : Intermédiaire.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Lying_Close-Grip_Barbell_Triceps_Press_To_Chin/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Lying Crossover', 'Abducteurs', 'Poids de corps', '1. Allongez-vous au sol with vos jambes extended.
2. Cross one leg over votre corps with the genou bent, attempting to touch the genou to the ground. Your partner should kneel beside you, holding your épaule down with one hand and controlling the crossed leg with the other. C''est votre position de départ.
3. Attempt to raise the bent genou off of the ground as your partner prevents any actual movement.
4. After 10-20 seconds, relax the leg as your partner gently presses the genou towards le sol. Répétez with the other side.', 'Niveau : Avancé.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Lying_Crossover/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Lying Dumbbell Tricep Extension', 'Triceps', 'Haltères', '1. Allongez-vous sur un banc plat while holding two haltères directly in front of you. vos bras should be fully extended at a angle de 90 degrés from your torse and le sol. The palms should be facing in and the coudes should be tucked in. C''est votre position de départ.
2. As you Inspirez and you keep the upper arms stationary with the coudes in, Lentement, lower the poids until the haltères are near your ears.
3. At that point, while keeping the coudes in and the upper arms stationary, use the triceps to bring the poids back up to the position de départ as you Expirez.
4. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Muscles secondaires : Pectoraux, Épaules. Niveau : Intermédiaire.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Lying_Dumbbell_Tricep_Extension/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Lying Face Down Plate Neck Resistance', 'Cou', 'Autre', '1. Lie face down with your whole body straight on a flat banc while holding a poids plate behind votre tête. Conseil : You will need to position yourself so that your épaules are slightly above the end of a flat banc in order for the upper poitrine, neck and face to be off the banc. C''est votre position de départ.
2. While keeping the plate secure on the back of votre tête Lentement, lower votre tête (as in saying "yes") as you Inspirez.
3. Raise votre tête back up to the position de départ in a semi-circular motion as you Expirez. Hold the contraction for a second.
4. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Niveau : Intermédiaire.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Lying_Face_Down_Plate_Neck_Resistance/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Lying Face Up Plate Neck Resistance', 'Cou', 'Autre', '1. Lie face up with your whole body straight on a flat banc while holding a poids plate on top of your forehead. Conseil : You will need to position yourself so that your épaules are slightly above the end of a flat banc in order for the traps, neck and head to be off the banc. C''est votre position de départ.
2. While keeping the plate secure on your forehead Lentement, lower votre tête back in a semi-circular motion as you Inspirez.
3. Raise votre tête back up to the position de départ in a semi-circular motion as you Expirez. Hold the contraction for a second.
4. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Niveau : Intermédiaire.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Lying_Face_Up_Plate_Neck_Resistance/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Lying Glute', 'Fessiers', 'Poids de corps', '1. Allongez-vous au sol with your partner kneeling beside you.
2. Flex the hanche of one leg, raising it off of le sol. Rotate the leg so the foot is over the opposite hanche, the lower leg perpendiculaire à votre corps. Your partner should hold the genou and cheville in place. C''est votre position de départ.
3. Attempt to push your leg towards your partner, who should be preventing any actual movement of the leg.
4. After 10-20 seconds, completely relax as your partner gently pushes the cheville and genou towards your poitrine. Be sure to inform your helper when the stretch is adequate to prevent injury or overstretching.', 'Muscles secondaires : Abducteurs. Niveau : Avancé.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Lying_Glute/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Lying Hamstring', 'Ischio-jambiers', 'Autre', '1. Allongez-vous au sol with vos jambes extended. Your partner should be kneeling beside you. Raise one leg up towards the ceiling and have your partner hold the cheville. Your partner can use their épaule to brace your leg if necessary. C''est votre position de départ.
2. With your partner holding your leg in place, attempt to flex the genou, contracting the ischio-jambiers for 10-20 seconds.
3. Then relax your leg, allowing your partner to gently push the leg towards votre tête. Be sure to inform your helper when the stretch is adequate to prevent injury or overstretching. Switch sides once complete.', 'Muscles secondaires : Mollets. Niveau : Avancé.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Lying_Hamstring/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Lying High Bench Barbell Curl', 'Biceps', 'Barre', '1. Lie face forward on a tall flat banc while holding a barre with a supinated grip (paumes vers up). Conseil : If you are holding a barre grab it using a épaule-width grip and if you are using an E-Z Bar grab it on the inner handles. Your upper body should be positioned in a way that the upper poitrine is over the end of the banc and the barre is hanging in front of you with the arms extended and perpendiculaire à le sol. C''est votre position de départ.
2. While keeping the coudes in and the upper arms stationary, curl the poids up in a semi-circular motion as you contract the biceps and expirez. Hold at the top of le mouvement for a second.
3. As you inspirez, Lentement, go back to the position de départ. Conseil : Maintain full control of the poids en permanence and avoid any swinging. Remember, only the forearms should move throughout le mouvement.
4. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Niveau : Intermédiaire.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Lying_High_Bench_Barbell_Curl/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Lying Leg Curls', 'Ischio-jambiers', 'Machine', '1. Adjust the machine lever to fit your height and lie face down on the leg curl machine with the pad of the lever on the back of vos jambes (just a few inches under the mollets). Conseil : Preferably use a leg curl machine that is angled as opposed to flat since an angled position is more favorable for ischio-jambiers recruitment.
2. Keeping the torse flat on the banc, ensure vos jambes are fully stretched and grab the side handles of the machine. Position your toes straight (or you can also use any of the other two stances described on the foot positioning section). C''est votre position de départ.
3. As you expirez, curl vos jambes up as far as possible without lifting the upper legs from the pad. Once you hit the entièrement contracté position, hold it for a second.
4. As you inspirez, bring the legs back to the initial position. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Lying_Leg_Curls/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Lying Machine Squat', 'Quadriceps', 'Machine', '1. Adjust the leg machine to a height that will allow you to get inside it with your genous bent and the cuisses slightly below parallel.
2. Once you select the poids, position yourself inside the machine face up with the genous bent and cuisses slightly below parallel to the platform. Make sure that the genous do not go past the toes. The angle created between the ischio-jambiers and the mollets should be one that is slightly less than 90 degrees (since your position de départ requires you to start slightly below parallel). votre dos and votre tête should be resting on the machine while your épaules are pressed under the épaule pads.
3. Place vos mains by the handles and position vos pieds slightly pointing out at a épaule width position. C''est votre position de départ.
4. While pressing with the balls of the feet as you Expirez, make your whole body erect as you squeeze the quads. Maintenez la position 1 seconde. Conseil : Since you are starting below parallel, you can opt to use vos mains to help you up by pressing on your cuisses only on the first repetition.
5. Lentement, squat down as you inspirez but instead of going all the way down to the position de départ, just stop once your cuisses are parallel to the platform. The angle between your ischio-jambiers and mollets should be a angle de 90 degrés.
6. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Muscles secondaires : Mollets, Fessiers, Ischio-jambiers. Niveau : Intermédiaire.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Lying_Machine_Squat/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Lying One-Arm Lateral Raise', 'Épaules', 'Haltères', '1. While holding a haltère in one hand, lay with your poitrine down on a flat banc. The other hand can be used to hold to the leg of the banc for stability.
2. Position the palm of the hand that is holding the haltère in a neutral manner (paumes vers your torse) as you keep the arm extended with the coude slightly bent. C''est votre position de départ.
3. Now raise the arm with the haltère to the side until your coude is at épaule height and your arm is roughly parallèle au sol as you expirez. Conseil : Maintain your arm perpendiculaire à the torse while keeping your arm extended throughout le mouvement. Also, keep the contraction at the top for a second.
4. Lentement, lower the haltère to the position de départ as you inspirez.
5. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Niveau : Intermédiaire.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Lying_One-Arm_Lateral_Raise/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Lying Prone Quadriceps', 'Quadriceps', 'Poids de corps', '1. Lay face down on le sol with your partner kneeling beside you. Flex one genou and raise that leg off the ground, attempting to touch your fessiers with your foot. Your partner should hold the genou and cheville. C''est votre position de départ.
2. Attempt to extend your genou while your partner prevents any actual movement.
3. After 10-20 seconds, relax your muscles as your partner gently pushes the foot towards your fessiers, further stretching the quadriceps and hanche flexors.
4. After 10-20 seconds, switch sides.', 'Niveau : Avancé.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Lying_Prone_Quadriceps/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Lying Rear Delt Raise', 'Épaules', 'Haltères', '1. While holding a haltère in each hand, lay with your poitrine down on a flat banc.
2. Position the palms of the hands in a neutral manner (paumes vers your torse) as you keep the arms extended with the coudes slightly bent. C''est votre position de départ.
3. Now raise the arms to the side until your coudes are at épaule height and vos bras are roughly parallèle au sol as you expirez. Conseil : Maintain vos bras perpendiculaire à the torse while keeping them extended throughout le mouvement. Also, keep the contraction at the top for a second.
4. Lentement, lower the haltères to the position de départ as you inspirez.
5. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité. and then switch to the other arm.', 'Niveau : Intermédiaire.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Lying_Rear_Delt_Raise/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Lying Supine Dumbbell Curl', 'Biceps', 'Haltères', '1. Allongez-vous sur un banc plat face up while holding a haltère in each arm on top of your cuisses.
2. Bring the haltères to the sides with the arms extended and the palms of the hands facing your cuisses (neutral grip).
3. While keeping the arms close to your torse and coudes in, Lentement, lower vos bras (as you keep them extended with a slight bend at the coudes) as far down towards le sol as you can go. Once you cannot go down any further, lock your upper arms in that position and that will be your position de départ.
4. As you Expirez, Lentement, begin to curl the poids up as you simultaneously rotate your poignets so that the palms of the hands face up. Continue curling the poids until your biceps are entièrement contracté and squeeze hard at the top position for a second. Conseil : Only the forearms should move. Upper arms should remain stationary and coudes should stay in throughout le mouvement.
5. Return back to the position de départ very slowly.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Lying_Supine_Dumbbell_Curl/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Lying T-Bar Row', 'Milieu du dos', 'Machine', '1. Load up the T-bar Row Machine with the desired poids and adjust the leg height so that your upper poitrine is at the top of the pad. Conseil : In some machines all you can do is stand on the appropriate step that allows you to be at a height that has the upper poitrine at the top of the pad.
2. Lay face down on the pad and grab the handles. You can either use a palms down, palms up, or palms in position depending on what part of votre dos you want to emphasize.
3. Lift the bar off the rack and extend vos bras in front of you. C''est votre position de départ.
4. As you expirez Lentement, pull the poids up and squeeze votre dos at the top of le mouvement. Conseil : Keep the upper arms as close to the torse as possible throughout le mouvement in order to better engage the back muscles. Also, do not lift votre corps off of the pad at any time and refrain from using the biceps to lift the poids.
5. After a second contraction at the top of le mouvement, as you inspirez, Lentement, go back down to the position de départ.
6. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Muscles secondaires : Biceps, Dos. Niveau : Intermédiaire.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Lying_T-Bar_Row/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Lying Triceps Press', 'Triceps', 'Barre EZ', '1. Allongez-vous sur un banc plat with either an e-z bar (my preference) or a straight bar placed on le sol behind votre tête and vos pieds on le sol.
2. Grab the bar behind you, using a medium overhand (pronated) grip, and raise the bar in front of you bras tendus. Conseil : The arms should be perpendiculaire à the torse and le sol. The coudes should be tucked in. C''est votre position de départ.
3. As you Inspirez, Lentement, lower the poids until the bar lightly touches your forehead while keeping the upper arms and coudes stationary.
4. At that point, use the triceps to bring the poids back up to the position de départ as you Expirez.
5. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Niveau : Intermédiaire.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Lying_Triceps_Press/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Machine Bench Press', 'Pectoraux', 'Machine', '1. Sit down on the poitrine Press Machine and select the poids.
2. Step on the lever provided by the machine since it will help you to bring the handles forward so that you can grab the handles and fully extend the arms.
3. Grab the handles with a palms-down grip and lift your coudes so that your upper arms are parallèle au sol to the sides of your torse. Conseil : Your forearms will be pointing forward since you are grabbing the handles. Once you bring the handles forward and extend the arms you will be at the position de départ.
4. Now bring the handles back towards you as you Inspirez.
5. Push the handles away from you as you flex your pecs and you Expirez. Hold the contraction for a second before going back to the position de départ.
6. Répétez for the recommended amount of reps.
7. When finished step on the lever again and Lentement, get the handles back to their original place.', 'Muscles secondaires : Épaules, Triceps. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Machine_Bench_Press/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Machine Bicep Curl', 'Biceps', 'Machine', '1. Adjust the seat to the appropriate height and make your poids selection. Place your upper arms against the pads and grasp the handles. C''est votre position de départ.
2. Perform le mouvement by flexing the coude, pulling your lower arm towards your upper arm.
3. Pause at the top of le mouvement, and then Lentement, return the poids to the position de départ.
4. Avoid returning the poids all the way to the stops until the set is complete to keep tension on the muscles being worked.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Machine_Bicep_Curl/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Machine Preacher Curls', 'Biceps', 'Machine', '1. Sit down on the Preacher Curl Machine and select the poids.
2. Place the back of your upper arms (your triceps) on the preacher pad provided and grab the handles using an prise en supination (paumes vers up). Conseil : Make sure that when you place the arms on the pad you keep the coudes in. C''est votre position de départ.
3. Now lift the handles as you expirez and you contract the biceps. At the top of the position make sure that you hold the contraction for a second. Conseil : Only the forearms should move. The upper arms should remain stationary and on the pad en permanence.
4. Lower the handles Lentement, back to the position de départ as you inspirez.
5. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Machine_Preacher_Curls/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Machine Shoulder (Military) Press', 'Épaules', 'Machine', '1. Sit down on the épaule Press Machine and select the poids.
2. Grab the handles to your sides as you keep the coudes bent and in line with your torse. C''est votre position de départ.
3. Now lift the handles as you expirez and you extend the arms fully. At the top of the position make sure that you hold the contraction for a second.
4. Lower the handles Lentement, back to the position de départ as you inspirez.
5. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Muscles secondaires : Triceps. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Machine_Shoulder_Military_Press/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Machine Triceps Extension', 'Triceps', 'Machine', '1. Adjust the seat to the appropriate height and make your poids selection. Place your upper arms against the pads and grasp the handles. C''est votre position de départ.
2. Perform le mouvement by extending the coude, pulling your lower arm away from your upper arm.
3. Pause at the completion of le mouvement, and then Lentement, return the poids to the position de départ.
4. Avoid returning the poids all the way to the stops until the set is complete to keep tension on the muscles being worked.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Machine_Triceps_Extension/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Medicine Ball Chest Pass', 'Pectoraux', 'Medecine ball', '1. You will need a partner for cet exercice. Lacking one, this movement can be performed against a wall.
2. Begin facing your partner holding the medicine ball at your torse with both hands.
3. Pull the ball to your poitrine, and reverse the motion by extending through the coudes. For sports applications, you can take a step as you throw.
4. Your partner should catch the ball, and throw it back to you.
5. Receive the throw with both hands at poitrine height.', 'Muscles secondaires : Épaules, Triceps. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Medicine_Ball_Chest_Pass/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Medicine Ball Full Twist', 'Abdominaux', 'Medecine ball', '1. For cet exercice you will need a medicine ball and a partner. Stand back to back with your partner, spaced 2-3 feet apart. C''est votre position de départ.
2. Hold the ball in front of the trunk. Open the hanches and turn the épaules at the same time as your partner.
3. For full rotation, you and your partner should twist in the same direction, i.e. counter-clockwise.
4. Pass the ball to your partner, and both of you can now twist in the opposite direction to Répétez the procedure.', 'Muscles secondaires : Épaules. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Medicine_Ball_Full_Twist/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Medicine Ball Scoop Throw', 'Épaules', 'Medecine ball', '1. Assume a semisquat stance with a medicine ball in vos mains. vos bras should hang so the ball is near vos pieds.
2. Begin by thrusting the hanches forward as you extend through the legs, jumping up.
3. As you do, swing vos bras up and over votre tête, keeping them extended, releasing the ball at the peak of your movement. The goal is to throw the ball the greatest distance behind you.', 'Muscles secondaires : Abdominaux, Ischio-jambiers, Quadriceps. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Medicine_Ball_Scoop_Throw/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Middle Back Shrug', 'Milieu du dos', 'Haltères', '1. Lie facedown on an incline banc while holding a haltère in each hand. vos bras should be fully extended hanging down and pointing towards le sol. The palms of vos mains should be facing each other. C''est votre position de départ.
2. As you expirez, squeeze your omoplates together and hold the contraction for a full second. Conseil : This movement is just like the reverse action of a hug, or trying to perform rear laterals as if you had no arms.
3. As you inspirez go back to the position de départ.
4. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Niveau : Intermédiaire.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Middle_Back_Shrug/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Middle Back Stretch', 'Milieu du dos', 'Autre', '1. Stand so vos pieds are épaule width apart and vos mains are on your hanches.
2. Twist at your waist until you feel a stretch. Hold for 10 to 15 seconds, then twist to the other side.', 'Muscles secondaires : Abdominaux, Dos, Bas du dos. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Middle_Back_Stretch/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Mixed Grip Chin', 'Milieu du dos', 'Autre', '1. Using a spacing that is just about 1 inch wider than épaule width, grab a pull-up bar with the palms of one hand facing forward and the palms of the other hand facing towards you. C''est votre position de départ.
2. Now start to pull yourself up as you expirez. Conseil : With the arm that has the paumes vers up concentrate on using the back muscles in order to perform le mouvement. The coude of that arm should remain close to the torse. With the other arm that has the paumes vers l''avant, the coudes will be away but in line with the torse. You will concentrate on using the lats to pull votre corps up.
3. After a second contraction at the top, start to Lentement, come down as you inspirez.
4. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.
5. On the following set, switch grips; so if you had the right hand with the paumes vers you and the left one with the paumes vers l''avant, on the next set you will have the paumes vers l''avant for the right hand and facing you for the left.', 'Muscles secondaires : Biceps, Dos. Niveau : Avancé.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Mixed_Grip_Chin/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Monster Walk', 'Abducteurs', 'Élastique', '1. Place a band around both chevilles and another around both genous. There should be enough tension that they are tight when vos pieds are épaule width apart.
2. To begin, take short steps forward alternating your left and right foot.
3. After several steps, do just the opposite and walk backward to where you started.', 'Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Monster_Walk/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Mountain Climbers', 'Quadriceps', 'Autre', '1. Begin in a pushup position, with your poids supported by vos mains and toes. Flexing the genou and hanche, bring one leg until the genou is approximately under the hanche. C''est votre position de départ.
2. Explosively reverse the positions of vos jambes, extending the bent leg until the leg is straight and supported by the toe, and bringing the other foot up with the hanche and genou flexed. Répétez in an alternating fashion for 20-30 seconds.', 'Muscles secondaires : Pectoraux, Ischio-jambiers, Épaules. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Mountain_Climbers/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Moving Claw Series', 'Ischio-jambiers', 'Autre', '1. This move helps prepare your running form to help you excel at sprinting. As you run, be sure to flex the genou, aiming to kick your fessiers as the hanche extends.
2. Reload the quad as the leg moves back forward, attacking the ground on the next step.
3. Ensure that as you run, you block with the arms, punching through in a rapid 1-2 motion.', 'Muscles secondaires : Mollets, Quadriceps. Niveau : Débutant.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Moving_Claw_Series/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Muscle Snatch', 'Ischio-jambiers', 'Barre', '1. Begin with a loaded barre held at the mid cuisse position with a prise large. The feet should be directly below the hanches, with the feet turned out as needed. Lower the hanches, with the poitrine up and the head looking forward. The épaules should be just in front of the bar. This will be the position de départ.
2. Begin the pull by driving through the front of the heels, raising the bar. Transition into the second pull by extending through the hanches genous and chevilles, driving the bar up as quickly as possible. The bar should be close to the body.
3. Continue raising the bar to the overhead position, without rebending the genous.', 'Muscles secondaires : Fessiers, Bas du dos, Quadriceps, Épaules, Triceps. Niveau : Intermédiaire.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Muscle_Snatch/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Muscle Up', 'Dos', 'Autre', '1. Grip the rings using a false grip, with the base of your palms on top of the rings. Initiate a pull up by pulling the coudes down to your side, flexing the coudes.
2. As you reach the top position of the pull-up, pull the rings to your armpits as you roll your épaules forward, allowing your coudes to move straight back behind you. This puts you into the proper position to continue into the dip portion of le mouvement.
3. Maintaining control and stability, extend through the coude to complete the motion.
4. Use care when lowering yourself to the ground.', 'Muscles secondaires : Abdominaux, Biceps, Avant-bras, Milieu du dos, Épaules, Trapèzes, Triceps. Niveau : Intermédiaire.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Muscle_Up/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Narrow Stance Hack Squats', 'Quadriceps', 'Machine', '1. Place the back of your torse against the back pad of the machine and hook your épaules under the épaule pads provided.
2. Position vos jambes in the platform using a less than épaule width narrow stance with the toes slightly pointed out. vos pieds should be around 3 inches or less apart. Conseil : Keep votre tête up en permanence and also maintain the back on the pad en permanence.
3. Place vos bras on the side handles of the machine and disengage the safety bars (which on most designs is done by moving the side handles from a facing front position to a diagonal position).
4. Now straighten vos jambes without locking the genous. C''est votre position de départ.
5. Begin to Lentement, lower the unit by bending the genous as you maintain a straight posture with the head up (back on the pad en permanence). Continue down until the angle between the upper leg and the mollets becomes slightly less than 90-degrees (which is the point in which the upper legs are below parallèle au sol). Inspirez as you perform this portion of le mouvement.
6. Begin to raise the unit as you expirez by pushing le sol with mainly with the heels of vos pieds as you straighten the legs again and go back to the position de départ.
7. Répétez selon le nombre de répétitions souhaité.', 'Muscles secondaires : Mollets, Fessiers, Ischio-jambiers. Niveau : Intermédiaire.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Narrow_Stance_Hack_Squats/0.jpg') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.exercises (name, muscle_group, equipment, description, tips, gif_url) VALUES ('Narrow Stance Leg Press', 'Quadriceps', 'Machine', '1. Using a leg press machine, sit down on the machine and place vos jambes on the platform directly in front of you at a less-than-épaule-width narrow stance with the toes slightly pointed out. vos pieds should be around 3 inches or less apart. Conseil : Keep votre tête up en permanence and also maintain the back on the pad en permanence.
2. Lower the safety bars holding the weighted platform in place and press the platform all the way up until vos jambes are fully extended in front of you. Conseil : Make sure that you do not lock your genous. Your torse and the legs should make a perfect angle de 90 degrés. C''est votre position de départ.
